{"_id":"f884590ba20749bd","name":"All Out!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the end of your turn</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By igniting your ki pathways you may speed up the circulation of the energy in your body. For the duration, all damage dealt by your <strong>Melee Techniques</strong> is increased by 1 damage step, this does not change the <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> portion of the <em>Damage</em> if it has one.</p>\n<p>(1d4&gt;1d6&gt;1d8&gt;1d10&gt;1d12&gt;2d6,&gt; etc)</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"all-out","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"6 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Until the end of your turn","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6494,"endLine":6506},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"a6067bfe9f5b1066","name":"Charge!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 20 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dash forward up without triggering <em>Attacks of Opprotunity</em> and roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"charge","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"20 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6507,"endLine":6517},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"e371faef96a6b06e","name":"Crane Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> against a target of your choice within range, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit and lowering the <strong>AC</strong> of the target by 1 for their next 2 rounds.\nA target cannot be affected by this or a similar effect from a technique more than once at a time.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"crane-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6518,"endLine":6530},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"f99a9f810c1df683","name":"Dempsey Roll","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Reaction, which you take when a creature targets you with a <em>Melee Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Technique</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the start of your next turn</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An expertly done boxer's counter. For the duration, each time a <em>Melee Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Technique</strong> that targets you, you can spend 8 <strong>Ki</strong>. When you do, you attempt to duck and weave granting yourself +2 to your <strong>AC</strong> against the triggering attack and then immediately make one <em>Unarmed Strike</em> in response.\nEach time you <em>Master</em> this <strong>Technique</strong> you may reduce the <strong>Ki Cost</strong> per punch by 1 or increase the <strong>AC</strong> bonus by 1 each time.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dempsey-roll","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Reaction, which you take when a creature targets you with a *Melee Attack Roll* or **Melee/Melee Weapon Technique**.","range":"Melee","duration":"Until the start of your next turn","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6531,"endLine":6543},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"cdf0a327e474a83b","name":"Dynamite Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>   5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> When you take the <em>Attack Action</em> or roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your attacks ignite with small explosions when they connect.</p>\n<p>You deal an additional 1d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> for the duration of the <em>Attack Action</em> or <strong>Technique</strong> that triggered this <strong>Technique's</strong> casting.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dynamite-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"When you take the *Attack Action* or roll a *Combo Attack Roll*","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6544,"endLine":6557},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"d58fe96bcb4acd9b","name":"Flurry of Blows","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 2 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target of your choice within range, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"flurry-of-blows","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6558,"endLine":6571},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"1468cdb4e190570e","name":"Hammer Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em>. On a successful hit the target must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be knocked <em>Prone</em>.</p>\n<p>If you use this <strong>Technique</strong> after you cast a <strong>Melee Technique</strong>, you gain Advantage on the* <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"hammer-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"6 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6572,"endLine":6584},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"0b362ed45c17d106","name":"Hurricane Kick","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self (10-foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You perform a devastating round house kick with enough force to send a shockwave away from you. Creatures in a range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em>, taking your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> and being <em>Launched</em> 10 feet on a failed save. On a successful save, they take half damage and are not <em>Launched</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"hurricane-kick","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (10-foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6585,"endLine":6595},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"bee084f969e831d1","name":"Ki Empowered Strikes","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> When you take the Attack Action or roll a Combo Attack Roll</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the start of your next turn</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Push your strikes even further using Ki. Your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> is increased by 1 step for the duration.</p>\n<p>(1d4&gt;1d6&gt;1d8&gt;1d10&gt;1d12&gt;2d6,&gt; etc)</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-empowered-strikes","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"When you take the Attack Action or roll a Combo Attack Roll","range":"Self","duration":"Until the start of your next turn","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6596,"endLine":6610},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"d9aebbeaddfc3b3d","name":"Lightning Jab","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attack at lightning speed, the target can not use their Reaction in response to this <strong>Technique</strong>.</p>\n<p>Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"lightning-jab","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6611,"endLine":6624},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"b6c9c4132ff73d26","name":"Power Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A single target of your choice within range must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or take your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> and being being <em>Launched</em> a total of 5x your <em>Strength Modifier</em> feet on a failure, half damage and no knockback on a success.</p>\n<p>If the target is <em>Launched</em> into a solid structure they may break through it at half speed, taking 1d6 for each 5 feet they travel through it.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"power-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6625,"endLine":6636},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"edf2257fbf1550e4","name":"Rush!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 3 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"rush","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6637,"endLine":6647},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"d9ffc4d39adb0742","name":"The Ol' One-Two","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  3 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A staple of trained combat, a quick combo from a boxing stance. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d4 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"the-ol-one-two","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"3 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6648,"endLine":6658},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"10860e1afa61fb21","name":"Wolf Fang Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A rapid flurry of jabs and kicks designed to mimic the ferocity of a desert wolf. Make 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing 1d4 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> for each attack. At the resulution of this <strong>Technique</strong>, the target gets knocked back 5 feet for each <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> that hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"wolf-fang-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6659,"endLine":6672},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"79bf36b5316bd564","name":"Amazing Impact","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A stomach shot designed to knock the wind out of an opponent.</p>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit and the target cannot take Reactions until the start of their next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"amazing-impact","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6675,"endLine":6687},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"9ead963b184866ef","name":"Angry Hit","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A charge attack where you close in and seemingly disappear, then strike a hit as soon as you appear in front of your opponent.</p>\n<p>Choose a target within your move distance, you vanish and appear in a chosen location within 5 feet of them without provoking <em>Attacks of Opportunity</em> and make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"angry-hit","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6688,"endLine":6701},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"11739458cab4ebda","name":"Aura Lariot","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          30 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cover yourself in energy before ramming a target to the ground. Make a Combo attack roll dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> and knocking the target <em>Prone</em> on a hit. You end this <strong>Technique</strong> in the nearest unoccupided space from the target.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"aura-lariot","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6702,"endLine":6715},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"7c1814d58712e1de","name":"Blitz","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A quick and basic combo attack.</p>\n<p>Roll 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target in range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"blitz","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6716,"endLine":6728},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"6d0217cbb8b81d57","name":"Burning Rush","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A flurry of flaming strikes at the opponent. Roll 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> to any target in your melee range dealing 2d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"burning-rush","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6729,"endLine":6740},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"f1b37c63fd3ee25b","name":"Crusher Blow","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A supercharged punch that breaks through defenses. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit. This damage can not be reduced by any means.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"crusher-blow","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6741,"endLine":6753},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"56ba79d653f463b2","name":"Deadly Dance","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the start of your next turn.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For the duration of this <strong>Technique</strong>, if you hit a creature with the <em>Attack Action</em>, <em>Ki Blast Action</em>, or a <strong>Technique</strong> this turn it can not make <em>Attacks of Opprotunity</em> until the end of their next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"deadly-dance","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Self","duration":"Until the start of your next turn.","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6754,"endLine":6767},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"d485d8fbbf7f58dc","name":"Dragon Throw","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          10 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You make a lunging grab at a target near you before launching them away. Make a Combo Attack Roll, on a hit the user grabs the enemy, spins them around, and <em>Launches</em> them 10x your <em>Strength Modifier</em> feet in any direction. You end this <strong>Technique</strong> in the nearest unoccupied space if it fails and in the target's original square on a success.</p>\n<p>Targets take an additional 1d6 Damage per 10 feet <em>Launched</em> if they hit a solid surface.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dragon-throw","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"10 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6768,"endLine":6780},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"de63718657cf4aa4","name":"Evil Whirlwind","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (10 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A dynamic attack that kicks the surrounding area to pieces.\nAll Creatures within the range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em>, half on a save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"evil-whirlwind","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (10 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6781,"endLine":6793},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"03196baf371ca0b3","name":"Meteor Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (20 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Strike out with a supercharged punch strong enough to send a shockwave through the air. All targets in range must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be knocked <em>Prone</em> and take 2d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a fail, taking half damage and are not <em>Prone</em> on a Success.</p>\n<p>If a Target is within <em>Melee Range</em> you may roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing 2d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit.  Targets hit with this <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> fail the <em>Strength Saving Throw</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"meteor-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (20 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6794,"endLine":6809},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"de80675f2432ca3f","name":"Surpass Your Limits!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> When you take the <em>Attack Action</em> or cast a <strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Technique</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the start of your next turn</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Push your strikes even FURTHER using Ki. For the duration of this technique you gain +1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to all <em>Melee Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Techniques</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"surpass-your-limits","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"When you take the *Attack Action* or cast a **Melee/Melee Weapon Technique**","range":"Self","duration":"Until the start of your next turn","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6810,"endLine":6830},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"8c0900a8f8eb2cf7","name":"All Clear","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  60 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Reaction, which you take when subject to a <em>Basic Ki Blast</em> or <strong>Ki Technique</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A frontal sweeping attack that can negate Ki Waves.\nWhen you are subject to a <em>Basic Ki Blast</em> or <strong>Ki Technique</strong> of <strong>Rank 3</strong> or below, you may use this <strong>Technique</strong> and negate the attack. If the <strong>Technique</strong> is a <strong>Rank 4</strong>, the damage is halved instead.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"all-clear","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"60 Ki","castingTime":"1 Reaction, which you take when subject to a *Basic Ki Blast* or **Ki Technique**","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6833,"endLine":6844},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"996ca1295a85ee54","name":"Arm Break","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A supercharged combo that breaks through defenses.\nMake 2 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> +3d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> each on a hit. This <em>Damage</em> cannot be reduced by <strong>Blocking</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"arm-break","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6845,"endLine":6856},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"fa03fdf7b5ccf67b","name":"Blinding Wolf Fang Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wolf Fang Fist</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A rapid flurry of jabs and kicks designed to mimic the ferocity of a desert wolf. Make 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing 1d8 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> for each attack. At the resulution of this <strong>Technique</strong>, the target gets knocked back 5 feet for each <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> that hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"blinding-wolf-fang-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Wolf Fang Fist","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6857,"endLine":6870},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"bd1a13858e2538d2","name":"Breakstorm","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 6 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em>  against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"breakstorm","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6871,"endLine":6882},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"e1174e49152d649f","name":"Death Crasher","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em>, increased by one step, on a hit.</p>\n<p>(1d4&gt;1d6&gt;1d8&gt;1d10&gt;1d12&gt;2d6,&gt; etc)</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"death-crasher","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6883,"endLine":6896},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"6ebde389f76b66b2","name":"Destructive Rampage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self(100 foot Radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You dart around a large area attacking in rapid succession.\nMake 5 combo attack rolls dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit before returning to your starting location.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"destructive-rampage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self(100 foot Radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6897,"endLine":6908},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"e0342921a53a3893","name":"Drill Kick","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A fast spinning dropkick that throws the target off balance.</p>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit. This <strong>Technique</strong> ignores <em>Proficiency Bonuses</em> to the target's <strong>AC</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"drill-kick","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6909,"endLine":6924},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"6c196b0520a09c34","name":"Erupting Meteor Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Meteor Strike, Lightning Jab</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee (20 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Strike out with a supercharged punch strong enough to send a burning shockwave through the air. All targets in range must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be knocked <em>Prone</em> and take 2d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> + 2d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> on a fail, taking half damage and are not <em>Prone</em> on a Success.</p>\n<p>If a Target is within <em>Melee Range</em> you may roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing 2d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> + 2d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> on a hit.  Targets hit with this <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> fail the <em>Strength Saving Throw</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"erupting-meteor-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee (20 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Meteor Strike, Lightning Jab","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6925,"endLine":6938},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"8d3af6e7035a2a43","name":"Evil Typhoon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self(10 foot Radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ki-enhanced dynamic attack that kicks the surrounding area to pieces.</p>\n<p>All Creatures in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take your 4dX, where X is your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em>, half on a save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"evil-typhoon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self(10 foot Radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6939,"endLine":6951},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"0161db6ee2c94865","name":"Gigantic Rage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  45 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Grab the opponent before verociously attacking them. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your Unarmed Strike Damage Die + 4d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> and leaves the target <em>Prone</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>If you have the <em>Enraged Condition</em> this <strong>Technique</strong> has Advantage.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"gigantic-rage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"45 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6952,"endLine":6966},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"fd30650428def9c0","name":"God Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ferociously powerful haymaker from close range. Make an <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing 4d10 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> and leaving the target <em>Stunned</em> until the end of their next turn on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"god-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6967,"endLine":6978},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"ec09c9a799c60a36","name":"Piercing Punch","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Crane Strike</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit and lowering the <strong>AC</strong> of the target by 1 for their next 2 Turns.</p>\n<p>A target cannot be affected by this or a similar effect from a <strong>Technique</strong> more than once at a time.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"piercing-punch","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Crane Strike","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6979,"endLine":6993},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"ba31be4bc0bf3822","name":"Power Rush","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"power-rush","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":6994,"endLine":7004},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"2190095ae2730d53","name":"Pressure Sign","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A true and confidant strike. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> on a hit. This <strong>Technique</strong> has Advantage in <em>Clash Checks</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"pressure-sign","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7005,"endLine":7017},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"b4bc4e0e1874154b","name":"Shockwave Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (45 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Punch the air with the sole purpose of destablizing targets in front of you.</p>\n<p>All Targets in range  must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be knocked <em>Prone</em> and they can not take Reactions until the end of your next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"shockwave-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (45 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7018,"endLine":7030},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"dd133e1dad69f7ff","name":"Thunder Combo","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> When you take the <em>Attack Action</em></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          For the duration of the <em>Attack Action.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You focus all your power into speed into a series of fast moving attacks.</p>\n<p>For the duration of this <strong>Technique</strong> you gain additional <em>Movement Speed</em> equal to your <em>Base Movement Speed</em> and gain an additional 2d6 <em>Thunder Damage</em> for each 10 feet you move in a straight line between Attack Rolls.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"thunder-combo","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"When you take the *Attack Action*","range":"Melee","duration":"For the duration of the *Attack Action.*","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7031,"endLine":7043},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"8ebe4076d08b6dfd","name":"Armor Break","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Piercing Punch</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous (Special)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Strike your foe and either shatter their armor or cut their ki connection to their defenses.</p>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit. You also remove one of the following from the target's <strong>AC</strong> calculation.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armor Bonus</li>\n<li>Wisdom Modifier</li>\n<li>Constitution Modifier</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This effect lasts for 30 Seconds or until the <em>Armor</em> is repaired.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"armor-break","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous (Special)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Piercing Punch","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7047,"endLine":7073},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"91bec616cd673e0e","name":"Blitz Rush","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Blitz</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 8 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"blitz-rush","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Blitz","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7074,"endLine":7085},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"b9f3f4151750f219","name":"Elite Combo","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  65 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make 8 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> against a target of your choice within range dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> on a hit. You may move up to 10 Feet between each <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, without provoking <em>Attacks of Opprotunity.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"elite-combo","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"65 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7086,"endLine":7098},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"f469132e531cb388","name":"Explosion Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous (Special)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A strike to the midsection that explodes into a burst of energy.</p>\n<p>Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 10d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"explosion-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous (Special)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7099,"endLine":7113},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"40899de5660b9b82","name":"Soaring Dragon Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  60 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Coat your arm in the visage of a dragon or similar beast before tearing apart a targets body and soul. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 4d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. This Damage affects both the Target's <strong>HP</strong> and <strong>Ki</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"soaring-dragon-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"60 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Melee","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7114,"endLine":7124},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"e9a87161bb64a936","name":"Super Dragon Fist","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  75 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self (100 ft line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Create the visage of the eternal dragon and punch it out and through enemies in front of you. Creatures in Range must make a Dexterity Saving Throw or take your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 10d12 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-dragon-fist","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"melee","kiCost":"75 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (100 ft line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"melee"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7125,"endLine":7145},"techniqueSection":"melee"}}}
{"_id":"20f657a5d896b2e7","name":"Bonk!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Raise your weapon high above your head for an empowered attack. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d6 <em>Weapon Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>This <em>Attack Roll</em> is a <em>Critical Hit</em> on a roll of 19 or 20.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"bonk","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"6 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7151,"endLine":7164},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"11a5a497f3f401bb","name":"Flurry","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A quick rush using whatever is in your hands. Roll 2 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"flurry","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7165,"endLine":7177},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"26627f7ca6cfec51","name":"Iai!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Reaction, when you are targeted by a <em>Melee Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Melee Technique</strong> by a creature in your <em>Melee Range</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You draw and swipe with your weapon at lightning speed. Make a  <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> and grants disadvantage on the triggering attack roll.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"iai","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Reaction, when you are targeted by a *Melee Attack Roll* or **Melee Technique** by a creature in your *Melee Range*.","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7178,"endLine":7190},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"d0c73823bda3dbf7","name":"I'll Shoot you!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You focus your shot with a small portion of your ki, firing it once they are within range with much more force. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d4 <em>Damage</em>. Creatures who are hit with this attack are knocked back 15 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"i-ll-shoot-you","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"6 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7191,"endLine":7203},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"e69fcc2ef303584f","name":"Pincushion","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Light or Finesse Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You make a flurrious storm of strikes against a target in range. Roll 3 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"pincushion","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Light or Finesse Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7204,"endLine":7215},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"8cabe900dd5662c1","name":"Shining Slash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ki-charged weapon strike. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 2d6 damage on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"shining-slash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7216,"endLine":7228},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"95369b81b7f88476","name":"Staggering Clash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Reaction, when you are targeted by a <em>Melee Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Melee Technique</strong> by a creature in your <em>Melee Range</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You strike out to clash against against an incoming attack, attempting to overpower their stance. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> and knocking the target <em>Prone</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"staggering-clash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Reaction, when you are targeted by a *Melee Attack Roll* or **Melee Technique** by a creature in your *Melee Range*.","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7229,"endLine":7242},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"bf1db251125cb944","name":"Whirlwind","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>As quick spin-attack against all creatures in  your reach. All creatures within range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d10 <em>Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"whirlwind","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7243,"endLine":7254},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"92571cf7a14baaf7","name":"Brave Slash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> When you take the <em>Attack Action</em> or roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> with a qualifying <em>Weapon</em></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Until the start of your next turn</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You add energy to your weapon sending ki facsimiles of your attacks. For the duration of this technique your <em>Melee Weapons</em> gain a 30 foot range and have their <em>Damage Type</em> changed to <em>Ki Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"brave-slash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"When you take the *Attack Action* or roll a *Combo Attack Roll* with a qualifying *Weapon*","range":"Self","duration":"Until the start of your next turn","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7257,"endLine":7270},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"3d680389dd5a2a19","name":"Cyclone","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 <em>Mastery Star</em> in <em>Whirlwind</em></li>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 14 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An supercharged spin move against all creatures in the vicinity. All creatures within range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"cyclone","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"14 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Mastery Star* in *Whirlwind*","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7271,"endLine":7284},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"801b6ef43a309085","name":"Deadly Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Collect all of your energy to your arms for a lightning fast attack. Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 3d8 damage on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"deadly-strike","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7285,"endLine":7297},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"1c217055cb3f2b59","name":"Finishing Blow","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You make a jumping strike meant to deal maximum damage. This attack can only be used against a Prone Target. If you would make cast this technique using a <em>Thrown</em> weapon, you ignore any forms of detriments to your attack roll due to range (including disadvantage).</p>\n<p>Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> dealing 2x your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"finishing-blow","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7298,"endLine":7312},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"8c56987358b25769","name":"Flurry Assault","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong>  1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll 3 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d6 <em>Damage</em> each on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"flurry-assault","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7313,"endLine":7324},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"cec5c9b83b9f7c7e","name":"Focus","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki per +1</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Upkeep</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You funnel your energy into your held weapon to empower it. For each 10 <strong>Ki</strong> you spend when casting casting this technique, to a maximum of 30 <strong>Ki</strong>, your equipped weapon gains a +1 <em>Static Bonus</em> and a +1 to Damage Rolls until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>This Technique can not be mastered.</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"focus","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"10 Ki per +1","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Self","duration":"Upkeep","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7325,"endLine":7340},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"1d905700fc8f7fdf","name":"Ravenous Claw","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  18 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong>  1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range(15 Foot Cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By collecting energy in your weapon you can send out energy facsimiles in a cone in front of you. All creatures in the cone must make a dexterity saving throw, taking your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 3d8 <em>Damage</em> and creatures are knocked back to the end of the cone on a failure or half damage and no knockback on a success.</p>\n<p>Whenever you <em>Charge</em> this <strong>Technique</strong>, increase the range of the <em>Cone</em> by 5 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ravenous-claw","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"18 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range(15 Foot Cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7341,"endLine":7357},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"e1d270c6027882f4","name":"Shining Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 14 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong>  1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Reaction, when a creature would succeed a saving throw against a <strong>Technique/Spell</strong> casted by you.</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Movement Speed</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You take advantage of their focus in their success and go up to a creature, making an attack to set you up for the next one. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, on a hit dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d10 <em>Damage</em> and the creature cannot react to the next attack from you or an allied creature.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"shining-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"14 Ki","castingTime":"1 Reaction, when a creature would succeed a saving throw against a **Technique/Spell** casted by you.","range":"Movement Speed","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7358,"endLine":7370},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"0424c7d057f3e594","name":"Skirmish","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  18 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong>  1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A wild flurry of swings that is hard to match. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, on a hit dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Damage</em>. This <strong>Technique</strong> has Advantage on <strong>Clashes</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"skirmish","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"18 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7371,"endLine":7383},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"64a40227e8cd4e7c","name":"Tear Them Down","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You take a moment to inspect a target, looking for any weak points. Choose 1 target in range, the next <em>Weapon Attack</em> you make against that target using <em>Simple or Martial Weapons</em> ignores their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> and <strong>Power Bonus</strong> to <strong>AC</strong>.</p>\n<p>This <strong>Technique</strong> is ended if you use it again before attacking the target.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tear-them-down","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"60 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7384,"endLine":7399},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"ad81fb854cb93699","name":"Vulcan Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  14 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 3x Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You begin to charge your weapon to make a barrage of projectiles launched towards the enemy. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> against a target that you can see in range, on a hit dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 4d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"vulcan-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"14 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"3x Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7400,"endLine":7411},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"f7140d085c15fbe8","name":"Brave Flurry","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 30 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You fire a flurry of blasts from your weapon, basing it out of the type of weapon that you wield. Make a number of <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> equal to half of your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, each dealing your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> on a hit. Each attack may target a different target or each can indiviually be sent at the same.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"brave-flurry","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7413,"endLine":7426},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"87af3e5053c16fd9","name":"Brave Weapon Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Movement Speed</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You move to a creature that is within your movement speed, you then make two <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em>. On a hit, you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em>.</p>\n<p>At the end of this <strong>Technique</strong> you may make an additional <em>Weapon Attack</em>, if you hit at least 1 of the <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em>, dealing 2x your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> on a hit.  If both <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> hit, you gain <em>Advantage</em> on the <em>Weapon Attack</em>. If this <em>Weapon Attack</em> is a <em>Critcal Hit</em>, it instead deals 4x <em>Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"brave-weapon-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Movement Speed","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7427,"endLine":7441},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"9ba5723dad7e8ed4","name":"Smoldering Weapon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 24 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You attack at such speed that it ignites your weapon and your target. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>,on a hit you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 6d6 <em>Fire Damage</em>.</p>\n<p>On a hit, the target must make a <em>Constitution Saving Throw</em>, on a failure, they take 2d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> at the start of their next turn where they then must repeat the <em>Saving Throw</em> or repeat the effect on their subsequent turns until they pass or the caster's <strong>Character Level</strong> in Rounds elapses.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"smoldering-weapon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"24 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7442,"endLine":7455},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"bf2a94bb015b0131","name":"Darkness Flurry Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki per <em>Combo Attack Roll</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequsite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You gather ki throughout your body and focus onto enhancing your speed, you may make a number of <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> up to a max of your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>. On each hit, you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> plus  your <em>Weapon Damage Ability Modifier</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"darkness-flurry-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"12 Ki per *Combo Attack Roll*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7456,"endLine":7467},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"be3214a019563c9a","name":"Energy Shot","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ammo be damned, you pour your ki straight through your weapon. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, ignoring all form of bonus to <strong>AC</strong> from <strong>Techniques/Spells</strong>. On a hit, you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 5d6 <em>Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"energy-shot","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7468,"endLine":7484},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"3e56ea001b9f2522","name":"Evil Spear","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You arc your weapon and launch your weapon towards the enemy. If the weapon has the <em>Thrown Property</em>, the ranged of this <strong>Technique</strong> becomes the weapon's long range.  Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>,on a hit you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 10d4 <em>Damage</em> and the weapon is lodged onto them.</p>\n<p>Creatures have Disadvantage on all <em>Attack Rolls</em> they would make while this weapon is embedded. A creature may spend their action to make a <em>Athletics Check</em> against your <strong>Melee Technique Save DC</strong> to remove the weapon from their body.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"evil-spear","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7485,"endLine":7498},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"295f049afb84662e","name":"Rakshasa Claw","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action, when you use your action to take the <em>Attack Action</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By funneling ki into your weapon you can fire out ki projectiles of your equipped weapon. For the duration of your <em>Attack Action</em> your equipped weapons gain a range of 60 feet and have their <em>Damage Type</em> replaced with <em>Ki Damage</em>. If your weapon already had a range, both its long and short range increases by half its <em>Long Range Distance</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"rakshasa-claw","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action, when you use your action to take the *Attack Action*.","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7499,"endLine":7510},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"8800b40423d410ce","name":"Dimensional Flurry Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 1 Target that you can see or 1 Target that you can find through <em>Sense Ki.</em></li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your attacks strike with the force to open wormholes. Make a number of <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> equal to half your Proficiency Bonus, rounded up, against a target in  range. On each hit, they take your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 1d6 <em>Ki Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dimensional-flurry-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"1 Target that you can see or 1 Target that you can find through *Sense Ki.*","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7512,"endLine":7525},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"61698aa68e9657ab","name":"Divine Shot","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> Special</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Round</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Setting aside everything for the shot, you begin pouring your Ki into the next attack.</p>\n<p>You may spend an amount of <strong>Ki</strong> up to a max equal to 5x your <strong>Character Level</strong>. At the beginning of your next turn, you may make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, no <em>Action Economy</em> required. On a hit, you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 2d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> for every incrememnts of 10 <strong>Ki</strong> that you spend.</p>\n<p>While within the round, all creatures have Advantage on <em>Attack Rolls</em> against you and you have Disadvantage on <em>Dexterity Saving Throws</em> you make.</p>\n<p>When you would <em>Charge</em> this <strong>Technique</strong>, the <em>Action Economy</em> for the <em>Charge</em> is 1 Round.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"divine-shot","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Round","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Ranged Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7526,"endLine":7544},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"33ccf97d33ee50ce","name":"Time Breaker: Black Hole","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong> 1 <em>Simple or Martial Melee Weapon</em> that you are proficient with.</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Weapon's Range</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> Yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You begin to focus your ki into your weapon and then making an attack with enough strength to open up a Black Hole. Make a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, on a hit you deal your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 10d6 <em>Damage</em>.</p>\n<p>When a creature would be hit by this, roll 1d8 and transport the target to that Plane. If this <strong>Technique</strong> is <em>Mastered</em> you may choose to roll an additional 1d8 and choose between your rolled options.</p>\n<h5>Black Hole Destination</h5>\n<p>-count:2</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"text-align:left\">Plane</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">1d8</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Mortal Realm</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">HFIL</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Heaven</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Yemma's Palace</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">World of The Kais</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Realm between Time</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Demon Realm</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Your Choice</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"time-breaker-black-hole","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Weapon's Range","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Melee Weapon* that you are proficient with.","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7545,"endLine":7579},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"63ca9aec1f96c12b","name":"Weapon of Hope","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Weapon Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 100 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Prerequisite:</strong>  1 <em>Simple or Martial Weapon</em> that you are proficient with &amp; Spirit Bomb</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> Special</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Special</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable:</strong> No</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you would absorb a <em>Spirit Bomb</em>, you may channel the ki into your weapon. Your <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> becomes half the <em>Damage</em> of the <em>Spirit Bomb</em>. This <strong>Technique</strong> has a duration of 1 Round per <em>Spirit Bomb Size</em>. Once the duration of this <strong>Technique</strong> ends, you gain 2 <em>Ranks of Exhaustion</em> per size of the <em>Spirit Bomb</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"weapon-of-hope","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"weapon","kiCost":"100 Ki","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Special","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 *Simple or Martial Weapon* that you are proficient with & Spirit Bomb","tags":"weapon"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7580,"endLine":7590},"techniqueSection":"weapon"}}}
{"_id":"28eac6d76b0a7d57","name":"Dodon Ray","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 4 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (40 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A small beam shot from the finger causes an explosion on impact.  Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 3d4 <em>Force Damage</em>, half on a successful save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dodon-ray","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"4 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (40 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7593,"endLine":7605},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"08fc75aa9297f63a","name":"Consecutive Blasts","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (15 Cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire numerous small ki blasts in close range. All targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 2d12 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a successful save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"consecutive-blasts","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (15 Cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7606,"endLine":7621},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"3b9483ba87f5a2aa","name":"Explosive Wave","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 15 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (20 foot Radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Send a massive explosion of energy out in all directions from you. All creatures within range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 3d6 <em>Fire Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"explosive-wave","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"15 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (20 foot Radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7622,"endLine":7634},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"2e170866510aefeb","name":"Fient Shot","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 1d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. This <strong>Technique</strong> ignores half and three-forths cover.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"fient-shot","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7635,"endLine":7647},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"d418eee7cddae971","name":"Kamekameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 5</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> none</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A variant of the Kamehameha named by Goten. A smaller, less focused Kamehameha. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kamekameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"5","castingTime":"1 action","range":"60 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"none","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7648,"endLine":7660},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"97737b678fe31dcf","name":"Kiai!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (5 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Send out a pulse of ki outwards from yourself. All creatures must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Launched</em> 15 feet, being pushed back 5 Feet on a save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kiai","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (5 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7661,"endLine":7674},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"e0ade5385767917d","name":"Ki Blast Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 90 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a flurry of energy attacks. Make a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing 4d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. This <strong>Technique</strong> can have its <em>Casting Time</em> reduced by 1 step by spending double the <strong>Ki Cost</strong> upon casting.</p>\n<p>(1 Action &gt; 1 Bonus Action &gt; 1 Reaction)</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-blast-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"90 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7675,"endLine":7689},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"bb5fa4ff514b6d0f","name":"Ki Blast Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 45 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire one large ki ball. Make a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing 3dX, where X is your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em>, on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-blast-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"45 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7690,"endLine":7702},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"daab2b7d8192f36d","name":"Ki Blast Missle","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire one explosive energy shot at a target. One target of your choice in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 3d10 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-blast-missle","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7703,"endLine":7715},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"6cbad0e7b12bd759","name":"Max Power Energy Wave","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a pure beam of energy with the full force of your Ki. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing Xd6, where X is your <em>Wisdom Modifier.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"max-power-energy-wave","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7716,"endLine":7730},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"9efcb3127a664145","name":"Psycho Barrier","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki per +1 bonus</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Reaction when you are forced to make a <em>Constitution, Dexterity</em>, or <em>Strength Saving Throw</em></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Form a barrier of ki around you granting you a +1 bonus to the triggering <em>Saving Throw</em>. You may not increase this bonus beyond a +3 in this way.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"psycho-barrier","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"10 Ki per +1 bonus","castingTime":"1 Reaction when you are forced to make a *Constitution, Dexterity*, or *Strength Saving Throw*","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7731,"endLine":7743},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"45068f6c6c80b0f8","name":"Rapid Fire!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll 3 <em>Barrage Attack Rolls</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"rapid-fire","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"6 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7744,"endLine":7756},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"042aa82bf265aab8","name":"Skyline Blast","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  150 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Form a compressed apple sized ki blast in your hand before launching it at a target in range. Make a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing 3d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"skyline-blast","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"150 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7757,"endLine":7771},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"475d64f5703ee283","name":"Aura Shield","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Reaction, when you would take <em>Damage</em> or when you use a <strong>Defensive Manuever</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user concentrates their aura into a palpable wall of force. For the duration of the <em>Damaging Effect</em> or <strong>Defensive Manuever</strong>, you gain Resistance against one <em>Damage Type</em> of your choice.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"aura-shield","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Reaction, when you would take *Damage* or when you use a **Defensive Manuever**","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7774,"endLine":7786},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"308cf695959262ae","name":"Burning Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 45 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user sends out a fiery bout of energy from the hands. Roll a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 5d6 <em>Fire Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"burning-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"45 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7787,"endLine":7799},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"7dffcd4e2b16850a","name":"Continuous Energy Bullet","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki per Ki Blast</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a barrage of individual ki blasts. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> on a hit. You can fire a number of ki blasts up to a max of your <em>Proficiency Bonus.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"continuous-energy-bullet","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"10 Ki per Ki Blast","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7800,"endLine":7815},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"6856fe0f05138452","name":"Dark Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (80 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user condenses a black ball in the hands and then fires a beam from it.  Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 3d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dark-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (80 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7816,"endLine":7828},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"277a900e79acb287","name":"Death Beam","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A small beam shot from the finger. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em> dealing 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. After casting this you may, as a Bonus Action, fire an additional <em>Death Beam</em> for half the initial <strong>Ki Cost</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"death-beam","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7829,"endLine":7841},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"6f95bf0477a28ce2","name":"Destructo Disk","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (90 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A frisbee like attack that can cut through almost anything. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 6d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, no damage on a success. This <strong>Technique</strong> deals double damage to structures and <em>Constructs</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"destructo-disk","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (90 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7842,"endLine":7857},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"57b693ec8c646a87","name":"Fissure Slash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 45 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make a massive sweeping blade-like energy attack. Roll a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing Xd6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit, where X is for how many sets of 5 <strong>Ki</strong> you expend during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>.</p>\n<p>The maximum <em>Damage Dice Amount</em>, before charging is calculated, can not exceed your total <strong>Character Level</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"fissure-slash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"45 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7858,"endLine":7872},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"06ae5c0809a42cdc","name":"Furious Demon Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 90 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let out an immensly disruptive volley of attacks. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Damage</em> and gains the <em>Stunned Condition</em> until the end of their next turn on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"furious-demon-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"90 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7873,"endLine":7885},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"849e1356a34efe2f","name":"Galick Gun","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user condenses a purple ball in their hands and then fires a beam from it. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 3d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"galick-gun","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7886,"endLine":7900},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"c1883f6eac41123c","name":"Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self(100 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Famous Turtle Destruction Wave developed by Muten Roshi. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving throw</em> dealing 3d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self(100 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7901,"endLine":7913},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"59ac32587aef47b5","name":"Ki-Construct","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Upkeep</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user solidifies Ki around their hand, forming the crude shape of a weapon. You create and wield a unique <em>Weapon</em> with the following statistics:</p>\n<h5>Ki-Construct</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>You are proficient in this <em>Weapon</em></li>\n<li>Counts as <em>Finesse Martial Melee Weapon</em> or <em>Unarmed Strike</em> for the sake of <strong>Techniques.</strong><ul>\n<li><em>Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Techniques</strong> with this weapon can use your <em>Omni Attack Roll and Save DCs.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This <em>Weapon</em> deals your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 1d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li><strong>Weapon Techniques</strong> using this <em>Weapon</em> can be treated as a <strong>Ki Technique</strong> for the sake of <strong>Clashes</strong>.</li>\n<li>You can not be disarmed of this <em>Weapon</em>.\nThis <strong>Technique</strong> can be <em>Mastered</em> to increases the <em>Ki Damage Die</em> by 1 step or giving <em>Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Techniques</strong> casted using this weapon a +1 <em>Static Bonus</em> per <em>Mastery Star.</em></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-construct","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"8 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Self","duration":"Upkeep","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7914,"endLine":7941},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"a28f636fbcc26cfc","name":"Light Grenade","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (15 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A wide short range blast from cupped hands. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 4d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"light-grenade","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (15 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7942,"endLine":7953},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"e023558b2ed0f07b","name":"Masenko","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 80 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Placing your hands to your forehead you fire out a small but powerful beam of yellow energy. Roll a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"masenko","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"80 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7954,"endLine":7966},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"f9349ae1580948c8","name":"Missle Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 15 Ki per ki blast</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 30 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A rapid-fire barrage of energy blasts. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. You can fire a number of ki blasts up to a max of your <em>Proficiency Bonus.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"missle-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"15 Ki per ki blast","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7967,"endLine":7980},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"bdb801be8e758c5e","name":"Riot Javelin","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 15 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user creates an energy ball in his hand and then crushes it, enveloping his hand for a powerful short ranged Blast. Roll an <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing 3d12 Ki Damage on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"riot-javelin","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"15 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7981,"endLine":7995},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"a411dd6735e44e9c","name":"Scatter Shot","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 90 feet (15 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a single energy beam into the air that explodes and rains down a a barrage of ki bullets down in the area.</p>\n<p>Choose a point within range, all creatures of your choice in a 15 foot radius must make a Dexterity Saving Throw or take 3d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"scatter-shot","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"90 feet (15 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":7996,"endLine":8010},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"ffcdb9eb5210d70a","name":"Solar Flare","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (60 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user concentrates Ki in front of their eyes and sends a blinding light forward. All targets in range must make a <em>Constitution Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Blinded</em> until the end of their next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"solar-flare","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"12 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (60 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8011,"endLine":8023},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"eb9c3be3ca0ce4ec","name":"Super Explosive Wave","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Explosive Wave</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (45 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Send a massive explosion of energy out in all directions from you. All creatures within range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 4d12 <em>Fire Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-explosive-wave","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (45 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Explosive Wave*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8024,"endLine":8037},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"5f33fe198cab32a2","name":"100x Solar Flare","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Solar Flare</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (90 foot Sphere)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user concentrates Ki in front of their eyes and sends a blinding light forward. All targets in range must make a <em>Constitution Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Blinded</em> until the end of your next turn, until the start of their next turn on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"100x-solar-flare","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (90 foot Sphere)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Solar Flare*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8039,"endLine":8051},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"6bf858f64541c2d7","name":"Angry Shout","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (60 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fill your lungs with ki-enforced air and roar. All targets in range must make a <em>Constitution Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Stunned</em> until the end of their next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"angry-shout","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (60 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8052,"endLine":8064},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"c36731d6f386820a","name":"Big Bang Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  100 Feet (15 foot radius sphere)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Create a blue orb of energy in front of you before launching it to explode at your target. Choose a location within range, and all creatures in a 15 foot radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 8d8 <em>Fire Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"big-bang-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"100 Feet (15 foot radius sphere)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8065,"endLine":8079},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"d5c784bc20141a25","name":"Black Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Dark Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (100 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The form of the kamehameha that Goku Black used.\nTargets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 8d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"black-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (100 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Dark Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8080,"endLine":8093},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"da2819aa9f9ef8e8","name":"Blaster Meteor","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (50 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Surround yourself in a bubble of ki and fire out multiple ki blasts in all directions. All targets of your choice in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 4d12 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"blaster-meteor","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (50 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8094,"endLine":8106},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"c4416b5f15b4525e","name":"Death Ball","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  100 Feet (40 foot radius sphere)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ball of energy is created on the user's finger and thrown before exploding. For 15 <strong>Ki</strong> you may choose a point within range, targets in the technique's radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 5d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a failure, taking half damage on a success.</p>\n<p>You may spend additional sets of 15 <strong>Ki</strong> upon casting to add 2d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> and increase the sphere radius by 5 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"death-ball","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"100 Feet (40 foot radius sphere)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8107,"endLine":8124},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"58c4ec9df606538c","name":"Death Saucer","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Destructo Disk</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A purple frisbee like attack that does less damage than the destructo disk but is much more controlled.</p>\n<p>Roll 2 <em>Omni Attack Rolls</em> each dealing 5d6 <em>Slashing Damage</em> on a hit, dealing double damage to structures and <em>Constructs</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"death-saucer","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Destructo Disk*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8125,"endLine":8139},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"625cb436177e36c1","name":"Destructo Disk Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25x Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Destructo Disk</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (120 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A barrage of frisbee like attacks that can cut through almost anything. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 6d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, no damage on a success. This <strong>Technique</strong> deals double damage to structures and <em>Constructs</em>.</p>\n<p>You may fire an amount of Destructo Disks equal to your Proficiency Bonus by spending an additional 25 <strong>Ki</strong> per <em>Destructo Disk</em> after the first.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"destructo-disk-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"25x Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (120 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Destructo Disk*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8140,"endLine":8154},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"c298fab0b197ca26","name":"DIE DIE Missle Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 25 Ki per ki blast</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Missle Barrage</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 30 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 2d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. You can fire a number of ki blasts up to a max of your <em>Proficiency Bonus.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"die-die-missle-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"25 Ki per ki blast","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Missle Barrage*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8155,"endLine":8175},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"be8a04dd8221d1cf","name":"Final Flash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user creates an energy orb in each hand and places them together to fire a large powerful beam. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 6d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"final-flash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8176,"endLine":8189},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"291a8526c526333d","name":"Galactic Donuts","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user creates a ring construct of ki to restrain the user. One target of you choice within range must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Grappled</em> by the construct, remaking the <em>Saving Throw</em> as an <em>Action</em> on their turn to escape. While you are <em>Concentrating</em> on this <strong>Tehnique</strong> you may spend 30 <strong>Ki</strong> as an Action and throw an additional <em>Galactic Donut</em>, you may have a nymber of <em>Galactic Donuts</em> created at one time equal to your <strong>Ki Rank.</strong> If a target has more than a single <em>Galactic Donut</em> <em>Grappling</em> them, they are <em>Restrained</em> for the duration.</p>\n<p>Whenever you are <em>Concentrating</em> on this <strong>Technique</strong> you may use your Bonus Action to detonate all <em>Galactic Donuts</em>, dealing 4d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> to all targets affected by <em>Galactic Donuts</em> and ending this <strong>Technique</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"galactic-donuts","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8190,"endLine":8210},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"d7498e8a8951f9f5","name":"Hellzone Grenade","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10x Ki per ki orb</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Select a number of locations in range up to but not exceeding your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, for 10 <strong>Ki</strong> per location you may leave behind an orb of ki. At any moment you may choose to detonate any number of these orbs. All creatures within 5 Feet of these orbs must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 3d6 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n<p>Alternatively you may spend your Action to send all created ki orbs at a target of your choice, or take the collective damage of all ki orbs. The target makes one <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> for all created ki orbs taking their collective damage on a fail, halved on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"hellzone-grenade","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"10x Ki per ki orb","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8211,"endLine":8226},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"e88980603760c4ed","name":"Improved Ki-Construct","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ki-blade</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Upkeep (8 Ki)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user solidifies Ki around their hand, forming the crude shape of a weapon. You create and wield a unique <em>Melee Weapon</em> of your design with the following statistics:</p>\n<h5>Improved Ki-Construct</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>You are proficient in this <em>Weapon</em></li>\n<li>Counts as <em>Finesse Martial Melee Weapon</em> or <em>Unarmed Strike</em> for the sake of <strong>Techniques.</strong><ul>\n<li><em>Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Techniques</strong> with this weapon can use your <em>Omni Attack Roll and Save DCs.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This <em>Weapon</em> deals your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li><strong>Weapon Techniques</strong> using this <em>Weapon</em> can be treated as a <strong>Ki Technique</strong> for the sake of <strong>Clashes</strong>.</li>\n<li>You can not be disarmed of this <em>Weapon</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"improved-ki-construct","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"Upkeep (8 Ki)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Ki-blade","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8227,"endLine":8252},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"73f6a3bd740f351c","name":"Infinity Bullet","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki per attack</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 150 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a seemingly endless barrage of individual small ki blasts. You may make a number of <em>Barrage Attack Rolls</em> up to but not exceeding your <strong>Character Level</strong>, for 12 <strong>Ki</strong> per <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing 1d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a successful hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"infinity-bullet","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"12 Ki per attack","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"150 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8253,"endLine":8265},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"db71ae3318e13a3e","name":"Instant Galick Gun","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Galick Gun</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Form a powerful but condensed Galick Gun to strike a single target. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a successful hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"instant-galick-gun","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Galick Gun*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8266,"endLine":8280},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"7d32a59037a5c8b6","name":"Instant Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  100 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Form a powerful but condensed Kamehameha to strike a single target. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a successful hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"instant-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"100 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8281,"endLine":8294},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"ab3df2da5b640291","name":"Majin Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Dark Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  80 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Form a powerful but condensed Kamehameha fueled by dark energy to strike a single target. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a successful hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"majin-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"80 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Dark Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8295,"endLine":8310},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"fbf9502121e0639c","name":"Massive Explosive Wave","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Explosive Wave</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (60 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Send a massive explosion of energy out in all directions from you. All creatures within range must make a Dexterity Saving Throw or take 8d12 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"massive-explosive-wave","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (60 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Explosive Wave*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8311,"endLine":8322},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"4a07a2ef9d0518a4","name":"Mouth Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  45 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user fires a beam out of their mouth powered by their own life force. Roll a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. This attack may be used while <em>Grappled, Restrained,</em> or <em>Prone</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"mouth-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"25 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"45 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8323,"endLine":8335},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"89fbe5a4ff755ebf","name":"Paralysis Shocker","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  30 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose a target within range, The target must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be <em>Paralyzed</em> for the duration. As an Action on their turn, the target may attempt to make the save again to free themself.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"paralysis-shocker","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 Feet","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8336,"endLine":8348},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"3f215e74cd8b1d7d","name":"Perfect Energy Wave","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Max Power Energy Wave</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a ferocious beam of energy with the full force of your Ki. Make a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing a number of d10 equal to your <em>Wisdom Modifier</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"perfect-energy-wave","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Max Power Energy Wave*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8349,"endLine":8361},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"e16062c222e26722","name":"Special Beam Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (100 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A very powerful move that resembles a drill. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take Xd10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit, where X is for how many sets of 5 <strong>Ki</strong> you expend during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>, Half on a save.</p>\n<p>The maximum <em>Damage Dice Amount</em>, before charging is calculated, can not exceed your total <strong>Character Level</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"special-beam-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (100 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8362,"endLine":8376},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"5282dcf9ddf1c452","name":"Super Destructo Disk","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  40 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Destructo Disk</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (120 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Super charge the spin of the destructo disk making it almost unseeable to the eye. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 8d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, no damage on a success. This <strong>Technique</strong> deals double damage to structures and <em>Constructs</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-destructo-disk","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"40 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (120 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Destructo Disk*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8377,"endLine":8389},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"63c2a969a35e0019","name":"Super Galick Gun","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Instant Galick Gun</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (180 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Charges one of the strongest variants of the Galick Gun. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 8d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-galick-gun","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (180 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Instant Galick Gun*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8390,"endLine":8406},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"5a02fe66fa2b6fe0","name":"Super Ghost: Guardians","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15x Ki per <em>Super Ghost</em></li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>           1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user spits out a number of identical ghost versions of themselves up to or equal to half of their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded up. These are known as <em>Super Ghosts.</em></p>\n<p>The <em>Super Ghosts</em> float harmlessly around you for the duration. Whenever you are subject to an <em>Attack Roll</em> you may sacrifice a <em>Super Ghost</em> to take the hit instead of you and explode, dealing 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> to all creatures but yourself within 5 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-ghost-guardians","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"15x Ki per *Super Ghost*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8407,"endLine":8421},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"f4983180551d3b5b","name":"Super Ghost: Kamikazi Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  15x Ki per <em>Super Ghost</em></li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (60 foot)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>           1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user spits out a number of identical ghost versions of themselves up to or equal to half of their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded up. These are known as <em>Super Ghosts.</em></p>\n<p>The <em>Super Ghosts</em> float harmlessly around you for the duration. As an Action you may fire a <em>Super Ghost</em> at a target within range, rolling an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing your 2d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>Whenever you miss with one of these <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> you may use your Reaction to call the <em>Super Ghost</em> back to you before it explodes unnecessarily, a <em>Critical Fail</em> on the <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> will always result in losing the <em>Super Ghost.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-ghost-kamikazi-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"15x Ki per *Super Ghost*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (60 foot)","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8422,"endLine":8446},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"02f793defb783eed","name":"Super Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Instant Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (125 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An almost planet shattering kamehameha. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving throw</em> dealing 8d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (125 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Instant Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8447,"endLine":8459},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"7e89da4816d64e49","name":"Tribeam","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HP Cost:</strong>  5x HP</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet (30 foot cube)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user channels their own life force into their hands and fires it out as a square box.</p>\n<p>Choose a location you can see within 120 feet. All creatures in the <em>Cube's</em> range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take Xd10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit, where X is for how many sets of 5 <strong>HP</strong> you expend during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>, Half on a save.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tribeam","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet (30 foot cube)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8460,"endLine":8475},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"713389708badc22d","name":"Twin Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  45 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Instant Galick gun</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user fires a purple beam from each hand. Make 2 <em>Beam Attack Rolls</em> dealing 6d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on each successful hit. Each <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> can target a different target in range.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"twin-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"45 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Instant Galick gun*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8476,"endLine":8494},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"0cbecce64876c5ec","name":"Big Bang Final Flash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  90 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Big Bang Attack</em> and <em>Final Flash</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user forms two Big Bang Attacks in his hands and put them together forming a larger blue version of the Final Flash. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 12d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"big-bang-final-flash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"90 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Big Bang Attack* and *Final Flash*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8497,"endLine":8509},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"8672da851d0697d1","name":"Big Bang Grenade","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25x Ki per ki orb</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Big Bang Attack</em> and <em>Hellzone Grenade</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  200 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Select a number of locations in range up to but not exceeding your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, for 25 <strong>Ki</strong> per location you may leave behind an orb of ki. At any moment you may choose to detonate any number of these orbs. All creatures within 10 Feet of these orbs must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 5d6 <em>Ki Damage</em>, half on a success.</p>\n<p>Alternatively you may spend your Action to send all created ki orbs at a target of your choice, or take the collective damage of all ki orbs. The target and all creatures within 5 feet of them must make one <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> for all created ki orbs taking their collective damage on a fail, halved on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"big-bang-grenade","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"25x Ki per ki orb","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"200 feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Big Bang Attack* and *Hellzone Grenade*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8510,"endLine":8522},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"0341c11d337893d8","name":"Big Bang Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 80 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Big Bang Attack</em> and <em>Instant Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (20 foot cone)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user fires a kamehameha through a big bang attack turning it into a shotgun like attack. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 12d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"big-bang-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"80 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (20 foot cone)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Big Bang Attack* and *Instant Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8523,"endLine":8538},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"0872c44970d80d05","name":"Burning Storm","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 8 Ki per ki blast</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Ki Blast Barrage</em> and <em>Rapid Fire!</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a barrage of individual small ki blasts. Roll a number <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em> up to but not exceeding your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> for 8 <strong>Ki</strong> per <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"burning-storm","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"8 Ki per ki blast","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Ki Blast Barrage* and *Rapid Fire!*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8539,"endLine":8552},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"f720e5e3f0a65883","name":"Dark Impact","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  60 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Final Flash</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (300 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Two compressed energy spheres forced together into a devestating beam attack. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 12d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dark-impact","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"60 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (300 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Final Flash*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8553,"endLine":8565},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"dd967c092b0f0b18","name":"Destructive Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>   1 Star in <em>Burning Attack</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  60 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make a large ki ball at your side before launching it at highspeed toward the opponent. Roll a <em>Blast Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 6d12 <em>Fire Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"destructive-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"50 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"60 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Burning Attack*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8566,"endLine":8581},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"cf19887ef7fb5bdd","name":"Emperor's Barrage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10x Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Death Beam</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user sends a barrage of death beams in front of them. One target of your choice must make a Dexterity Saving Throw dealing Xd12 <em>Magical Piercing Damage</em> per 10 <strong>Ki</strong> spent during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>, half on a success.</p>\n<p>The maximum <em>Damage Dice Amount</em>, before charging is calculated, can not exceed double your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"emperor-s-barrage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"barrage","kiCost":"10x Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"120 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Death Beam*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8582,"endLine":8596},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"7147feb6a3a80e8f","name":"Final Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 80 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Final Flash</em> and <em>Super Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Super powered combo of Goku and Vegeta’s strongest moves. Two compressed energy spheres forced together into a devestating beam attack. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 12d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"final-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"80 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Final Flash* and *Super Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8597,"endLine":8610},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"6b9d8094eb23cae1","name":"Full Power Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  60 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Super Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>True to its name this is the strongest pure variation of the Kamehameha. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 12d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"full-power-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"60 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Super Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8611,"endLine":8626},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"31590871251eda97","name":"Galick Kamehameha","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  65 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Instant Galick Gun</em> and <em>Instant Kamehameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This attack fully captures the strengths of both moves. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 12d6 <em>Ki Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"galick-kamehameha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"65 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Instant Galick Gun* and *Instant Kamehameha*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8627,"endLine":8639},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"39d387f200f9dba9","name":"Hyper Special Beam Cannon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> Self (150 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong> Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A very powerful move that resembles a drill. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take X sets of 2d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit, where X is for how many sets of 15 <strong>Ki</strong> you expend during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>, Half on a save.</p>\n<p>The maximum <em>Damage Dice Amount</em>, before charging is calculated, can not exceed 3x your total <strong>Character Level</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"hyper-special-beam-cannon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (150 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8640,"endLine":8663},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"ba046c3aa0b14f78","name":"Ki Weapon","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  45 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Upkeep (15 Ki)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user creates a complete weapon construct made of ki. You create and wield a <em>Melee Weapon</em> of your choice with the following statistics:</p>\n<h5>Ki-Weapon</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>You are proficient in this <em>Weapon</em></li>\n<li><em>Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Techniques</strong> with this weapon can use your <em>Omni Attack Roll and Save DCs.</em></li>\n<li>This <em>Weapon</em> deal the choosen <em>Weapon Damage Die</em> + 3d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li><strong>Weapon Techniques</strong> using this <em>Weapon</em> can be treated as a <strong>Ki Technique</strong> for the sake of <strong>Clashes</strong>.</li>\n<li>You can not be disarmed of this <em>Weapon</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-weapon","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"45 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"Upkeep (15 Ki)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8664,"endLine":8695},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"fea7822b7b62808b","name":"Omega Blaster","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 75 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  300 Feet (30 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The explosive move of the legendary Broly, throw a marble sized energy blast that slowly grows before impact. Choose a location within range, all creatures within a 30 foot radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> or take 10d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"omega-blaster","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"75 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"300 Feet (30 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8696,"endLine":8707},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"23622e72e95cf273","name":"Spirit Sword","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  30 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Improved Ki-Construct</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Upkeep (10 Ki)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user solidifies Ki around their hand, forming the crude shape of a long energy blade with the following statistics:</p>\n<h5>Spirit Sword</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>You are proficient in this <em>Weapon</em></li>\n<li>Melee Attacks and <strong>Melee/Weapon Techniques</strong> with this weapon gain 5 Feet of <em>Reach</em><ul>\n<li>As a Bonus Action while this <strong>Technique</strong> is active, you may increase the <em>Reach</em> of this weapon by an additional 5 Feet by increasing the <strong>Upkeep Cost</strong> by 5 <strong>Ki.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Counts as <em>Finesse Martial Melee Weapon</em> or <em>Unarmed Strike</em> for the sake of <strong>Techniques.</strong><ul>\n<li><em>Attack Rolls</em> and <strong>Techniques</strong> with this weapon can use your <em>Omni Attack Roll and Save DCs.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This <em>Weapon</em> deals your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li><strong>Weapon Techniques</strong> using this <em>Weapon</em> can be treated as a <strong>Ki Technique</strong> for the sake of <strong>Clashes</strong>.</li>\n<li>You can not be disarmed of this <em>Weapon</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"spirit-sword","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"30 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"Upkeep (10 Ki)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Improved Ki-Construct*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8708,"endLine":8733},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"aed223fa936c6ec2","name":"Super Ghost: Kamikaze Guardians","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35x Ki per <em>Super Ghost</em></li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  1 Star in <em>Ultimate Ghost Kamikaze Attack</em> and <em>Ultimate Ghost Guardian</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (90 feet)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user spits out a number of identical ghost versions of themselves up to or equal to half of their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded up. These are known as <em>Super Ghosts.</em></p>\n<p>The <em>Super Ghosts</em> float harmlessly around you for the duration. Whenever you are subject to an <em>Attack Roll</em> you may sacrifice a <em>Super Ghost</em> to take the hit instead of you and explode, dealing 4d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> to all creatures but yourself within 5 feet.</p>\n<p>Alternatively as an Action you may fire a <em>Super Ghost</em> at a target within range, rolling an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing your 4d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>Whenever you miss with one of these <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> you may use your Reaction to call the <em>Super Ghost</em> back to you before it explodes unnecessarily, a <em>Critical Fail</em> on the <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> will always result in losing the <em>Super Ghost.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-ghost-kamikaze-guardians","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"35x Ki per *Super Ghost*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (90 feet)","duration":"1 Minute (concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Ultimate Ghost Kamikaze Attack* and *Ultimate Ghost Guardian*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8734,"endLine":8752},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"3d09001d9eae06a3","name":"Super Ghost: Ultimate Guardians","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25x Ki per <em>Super Ghost</em></li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Super Ghost Guardians</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user spits out a number of identical ghost versions of themselves up to or equal to half of their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded up. These are known as <em>Super Ghosts.</em></p>\n<p>The <em>Super Ghosts</em> float harmlessly around you for the duration. Whenever you are subject to an <em>Attack Roll</em> you may sacrifice a <em>Super Ghost</em> to take the hit instead of you and explode, dealing 3d10 <em>Ki Damage</em> to all creatures but yourself within 5 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-ghost-ultimate-guardians","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"25x Ki per *Super Ghost*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"1 Minute (concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Super Ghost Guardians*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8753,"endLine":8770},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"115c87cc305e8072","name":"Super Ghost: Ultimate Kamikaze Attack","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25x Ki per <em>Super Ghost</em></li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (60 feet)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user spits out a number of identical ghost versions of themselves up to or equal to half of their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded up. These are known as <em>Super Ghosts.</em></p>\n<p>The <em>Super Ghosts</em> float harmlessly around you for the duration. As an Action you may fire a <em>Super Ghost</em> at a target within range, rolling an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing your 3d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit.</p>\n<p>Whenever you miss with one of these <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> you may use your Reaction to call the <em>Super Ghost</em> back to you before it explodes unnecessarily, a <em>Critical Fail</em> on the <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> will always result in losing the <em>Super Ghost.</em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-ghost-ultimate-kamikaze-attack","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"25x Ki per *Super Ghost*","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (60 feet)","duration":"1 Minute (concentration)","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8771,"endLine":8797},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"75c507a3043442fd","name":"Stardust Breaker","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  80 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  20 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ball of hyper condensed Ki is crushed into dust and thrown at a high velocity at an opponent. Roll an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing damage on a hit based on the target's <em>Alignment</em>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evil: 30d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li>Neutral: 20d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li>Good: 10d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"stardust-breaker","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"omni","kiCost":"80 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"20 Feet","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8798,"endLine":8814},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"7c62b25e058ffe7b","name":"Supernova","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Death Ball</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  200 Feet (30 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Blast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A monstrous version of the death ball. For 25 <strong>Ki</strong> you may choose a point within range, targets in the technique's radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> taking 5d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a failure, taking half damage on a success.</p>\n<p>You may spend additional sets of 25 <strong>Ki</strong> upon casting to add 2d12 <em>Ki Damage</em> and increase the sphere radius by 10 feet.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"supernova","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"blast","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"200 Feet (30 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Death Ball*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8815,"endLine":8831},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"bd2e4ad3245e5a3c","name":"Ultimate Galick Gun","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  60 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Super Galick Gun</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (200 foot line)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>True to its name this is the strongest pure variation of the Galick Gun. Targets in range must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> dealing 12d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a fail, half on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultimate-galick-gun","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"beam","kiCost":"60 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self (200 foot line)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":true,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"1 Star in *Super Galick Gun*","tags":"ki"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8832,"endLine":8849},"techniqueSection":"ki"}}}
{"_id":"d15625ced056c88f","name":"Afterimage","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  5 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Move so quickly you leave a mirage of yourself behind.  For the duration of this <strong>Technique</strong>, your <strong>AC</strong> increases by 2.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"afterimage","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"5 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8851,"endLine":8863},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"a13a7a9a0b2f54b9","name":"Charge","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Minimum Charge</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By taking a moment to center your energy you can restore your <strong>Ki.</strong> Regain 18 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> if used as an Action, or 3d6 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> as an Bonus action.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"charge","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Minimum Charge*","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8864,"endLine":8875},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"2f7f5e33630e44da","name":"Full Power Charge","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Charge</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By taking a moment to center your energy you can restore your <strong>Ki.</strong> Regain 30 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> if used as an Action, or 3d10 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> as an Bonus action.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"full-power-charge","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Charge*","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8876,"endLine":8890},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"a29141743d0544a3","name":"Kamehame HAHA","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Kamehameha</em> or <em>Kamekameha</em></li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  10 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Round</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user starts to charge what appears to be the Kamehameha but instead of a beam a small explosion of confetti shoots out. One target of your choice must make an <em>Intellegence Saving Throw</em> against your <strong>Omni or Beam Save DC</strong>, your choice, or be <em>Stunned</em> until the start of their next turn.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kamehame-haha","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"10 Feet","duration":"1 Round","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Kamehameha* or *Kamekameha*","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8891,"endLine":8904},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"1247d12f3ba21c87","name":"Ki-Dash","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  10 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Immediately move up to your <em>Base Movement Speed</em> without provoking <em>Attacks of Opportunity</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-dash","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"10 Ki","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8905,"endLine":8929},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"02bb8475a61982b6","name":"Ki Empowerment","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  <em>Strength Score</em> ≥ 16</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Multiplies carrying and lifting capacities by 22.5 times normal until the start of your next turn after the <em>Duration</em>. If stressed to maximum this technique will cause detrimental effects to the user’s body (at the DM's discretion) (does not affect unarmed damage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>16 Strength= 18,000 lbs</li>\n<li>17 Strength= 19,125 lbs</li>\n<li>18 Strength= 20,250 lbs</li>\n<li>19 Strength= 21,375 lbs</li>\n<li>20 Strength= 22,500 lbs</li>\n<li>21 Strength= 23,625 lbs</li>\n<li>22 Strength= 24,750 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ki-empowerment","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"20 ki","castingTime":"1 action","range":"Self","duration":"1 Minute (concentration)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Strength Score* ≥ 16","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8930,"endLine":8951},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"a9ecbd62d3eaf3d2","name":"Maximum Charge","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 4 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  Full Power Charge</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By taking a moment to center your energy you can restore your <strong>Ki.</strong> Regain 36 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> if used as an Action, or 3d12 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> as an Bonus action.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"maximum-charge","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":4,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Full Power Charge","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8952,"endLine":8966},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"e66cb9e1f395f861","name":"Minimum Charge","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 1 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By taking a moment to center your energy you can restore your <strong>Ki.</strong> Regain 12 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> if used as an Action, or 3d4 + <em>Wisdom Modifier</em> <strong>Ki</strong> as an Bonus action.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"minimum-charge","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8967,"endLine":8980},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"260d6c5a5a3e2d46","name":"Parapara Dance","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  35 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  30 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose a number of creatures that you can see within range equal to your <em>Charisma Modifier</em>. The target begins a comic dance in place: shuffling, tapping its feet, and capering for the duration. Creatures that can't be <em>Charmed</em> are immune to this <strong>Technique</strong>.</p>\n<p>A dancing creature must use all its movement to dance without leaving its space and has Disadvantage on <em>Dexterity Saving Throws</em> and <em>Attack Rolls</em>. While the target is affected by this <strong>Technique</strong>, other creatures have Advantage on <em>Attack Rolls</em> against it. As an Action, a dancing creature makes a <em>Wisdom Saving Throw</em> against your <strong>Omni Save DC</strong> to regain control of itself. On a successful save, the effect ends.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"parapara-dance","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"35 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"30 Feet","duration":"1 Minute (concentration)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8981,"endLine":8997},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"f72fca06c4df80ee","name":"Power Up!","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          1 Minute (Concentration)</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Charge your energy and burst with power. You gain a +1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong> for the duration.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"power-up","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"20 Ki","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Self","duration":"1 Minute (Concentration)","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":8998,"endLine":9016},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"752f019846dd1bf0","name":"Spirit Bomb","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Special Rank Technique</em></p>\n<p>The congregation of all living things’ power willing collecting to the call of another. As an action on your turn you begin to charge energy, calling out to the universe around you.</p>\n<p>The user must roll a d100 to determine how much power is given and how long it takes to charge the spirit bomb. If the user has some form of way to ask for the energy, such as telepathy, a successful persuasion check can grant you an additional d100, taking the higher of the two rolls.</p>\n<p>Any allied creature that sees you cast this <strong>Technique</strong> can spend their Reaction to lend their energy, granting a +1 for each creature that does.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0-10: Energy is refused and the attack won’t form</li>\n<li>11-30: Energy is barely given it takes 3 rounds to charge a micro bomb; 8 to charge a spirit bomb; 12 to charge a super spirit bomb; and 20 to charge a universal</li>\n<li>31-60: Energy is given but only what creatures think they can spare. It takes 2 rounds to charge a micro bomb; 5 to charge a spirit bomb; 8 to charge a super spirit bomb; and 12 to charge a universal</li>\n<li>61-95: Every creature gives every ounce of power they can muster. It takes one round to charge a micro bomb; 3 to charge a spirit bomb; 5 to charge a super spirit bomb; and 8 to charge a universal</li>\n<li>96-100: The universe itself fuels your attack. A microbomb is instantly formed and it goes up a category every round.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Damage</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rank 1</strong> Micro bomb: 10d12 radiant damage (30 Foot Range)</li>\n<li><strong>Rank 2</strong> Spirit bomb: 30d12 radiant damage (100 Foot range, 30 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Rank 3</strong> Super spirit bomb: 50d12 radiant damage (300 Foot Range, 60 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Rank 4</strong> Universal spirit bomb: 70d12 radiant damage (500 Foot Range, 120 foot radius)<ul>\n<li><strong>Manuevers</strong> can not be used against this.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose a target or a location in range, the selected target and targets in the listed radius must make a <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em> against your highest <strong>Ki Technique Saving Throw DC</strong> or take damage as listed above, half on a successful save.</p>\n<h5>Absorbing a Spirit Bomb</h5>\n<p>Alternativly, you may absorb the <strong>Spirit Bomb</strong> rather than launch it. Absorbing the <em>Micro Spirit Bomb</em> gives you a choice of the following benefits for the next minute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>50 <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> for each <strong>Ki Rank</strong> of the <strong>Spirit Bomb</strong><ul>\n<li><strong>Techniques</strong> casted with this <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> ignores <em>Resistances</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong> for each <strong>Ki Rank</strong> of the <strong>Spirit Bomb</strong></li>\n<li>+1 <strong>AC</strong> for each <strong>Ki Rank</strong> of the <strong>Spirit Bomb</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Absorbing a <em>Universal Spirit Bomb</em> grants you a fourth option:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain 1 <strong>Temporary God Ki</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"spirit-bomb","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":0,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Action","range":"Special","duration":"Special","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9017,"endLine":9069},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"62124478e6dc09ea","name":"Spirit Buster","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 2 Other Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  Special</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (10 foot radius)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All creatures in a 10 foot radius of you must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> against your <strong>Omni Save DC</strong> or be <em>Launched</em> 15 feet away from you for every 10 <strong>Ki</strong> you spend during the casting of this <strong>Technique</strong>, and half as far on a success.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"spirit-buster","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":2,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"Special","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"Self (10 foot radius)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"None","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9070,"endLine":9082},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"91df65de9be4ab3e","name":"Warp Technique","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<h2><em>Rank 3 Other Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stamina Cost:</strong>  3 Stamina</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Instant Transmission</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action, whenever you cast a <strong>Technique</strong> as your Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  Self (Line of Sight)</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Other</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You have learned to use your <em>Instant Transmission</em> mid-combat to take your opponents off guard. Whenever you cast this <strong>Technique</strong> you may <em>Teleport</em> to an empty location within 5 feet of a target in range as you make your attack. The target has <em>Disadvantage</em> on <em>Dexterity</em> and <em>Strength Saving Throws</em> from the triggering <strong>Technique</strong> and do not gain their <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> to <strong>AC</strong> for the triggering <strong>Technique.</strong>\nIf a friendly creature is attempting to <strong>Tag Team Attack</strong> with you and they have a free hand to maintain contact with you, they travel with you and also gain the benefits of this <strong>Technique.</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"warp-technique","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":3,"techniqueType":"otherKi","kiCost":"Stamina: 3 Stamina","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action, whenever you cast a **Technique** as your Action","range":"Self (Line of Sight)","duration":"Instantaneous","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Instant Transmission*","tags":"otherKi"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9083,"endLine":9099},"techniqueSection":"otherKi"}}}
{"_id":"647b3f0e22c78d57","name":"Turtle Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dexterity ≥ 13</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The trusty Turtle School, focusing on overwhelming foes with swift flowing martial arts.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> for <em>Unarmed Strikes</em> and <strong>Melee Techniques</strong>.</li>\n<li>When you use your Action to make an <em>Unarmed Strike</em> you may make an additional <em>Unarmed Strike</em> as part of that Action.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"turtle-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Dexterity ≥ 13","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9105,"endLine":9111},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"94e4d675436650c5","name":"Crane Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Unarmored</em> <strong>AC</strong> ≥ 14+</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The rival style to the Turtle School focusing on defense. Fills their ranks by  targeting the naturally gifted.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC</strong> so long as you are not <em>Surprised.</em></li>\n<li>Once per <em>Short Rest</em> you may <strong>Block</strong> or <strong>Wild Sense</strong> without expending <strong>Stamina</strong>.</li>\n<li>You gain a 10 foot <em>Fly Speed</em> or increase your current <em>Fly Speed</em> by 10 feet.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"crane-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"*Unarmored* **AC** ≥ 14+","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9112,"endLine":9121},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"cb3a7047d3796dfc","name":"Wolf Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dexterity ≥ 15</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A lighting fast fighting style based on sharp strikes and battlefield control.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain +15 <em>Walk Speed</em></li>\n<li>When you cast the <em>Flurry of Blows</em> <strong>Technique</strong> or a <strong>Technique</strong> with <em>Wolf Fang</em> in the name, increase the <em>Damage Die</em> by 1 step.</li>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <em>Attack Rolls</em> when you take the <em>Attack Action</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"wolf-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Dexterity ≥ 15","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9122,"endLine":9130},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"e4933e19a9b21e4e","name":"Demon Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wisdom ≥ 15</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The defensive and thoughtful style of Majunior, the son of the Demon King Piccolo.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You may take the <em>Dodge Action</em> as a Bonus Action.</li>\n<li>all <strong>Beam/Barrage Techniques</strong> gain +50% range</li>\n<li>You may add half of your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> to <em>Concentration Checks</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"demon-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Wisdom ≥ 15","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9131,"endLine":9143},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"2a5246bf6076b09b","name":"Saiyan Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Strength ≥ 15</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ferocious and strength orriented fighting style</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <em>Unarmed Strikes</em> and <strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Techniques</strong> that use your <strong>Strength.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Melee/Melee Weapon Techniques</strong> have their <em>Damage Die</em> increased by 1 step.</li>\n<li>Your <em>Dexterity Modifier</em> is treated as one lower for <strong>AC</strong> calculation.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"saiyan-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Strength ≥ 15","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9144,"endLine":9153},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"3cca5e8512e0ad59","name":"Emperor Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dexterity ≥ 15 and Wisdom ≥ 13</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A fighting style made to use fast deadly strikes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>As an Action, you may make a single <em>Unarmed Strike</em> or <em>Weapon Attack</em> at advantage.</li>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <strong>Barrage Techniques</strong></li>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC</strong> so long as you are not <em>Surprised.</em></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"emperor-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Dexterity ≥ 15 and Wisdom ≥ 13","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9154,"endLine":9162},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"c5d93e83cb889197","name":"Future Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dexterity ≥ 13, 1 <em>Martial Weapon Proficiency</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A fighting style based around mixing weapons and ki attacks.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <em>Static Bonus</em> to attack rolls when using a <strong>Simple or Martial Weapon</strong> to take the attack action</li>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <strong>Weapon and Blast Techniques</strong></li>\n<li>If you do a melee weapon attack using a martial or simple weapon that you are proficient with as your action you can fire 2 ki blasts as your bonus action.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"future-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"Dexterity ≥ 13, 1 *Martial Weapon Proficiency*","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9163,"endLine":9170},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
{"_id":"46550b50d3a6f02b","name":"Magic Style","type":"technique","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <strong>Mysticism/Mysticism: Burst Class Feature</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can draw the most out of your spells.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <strong>Spells</strong></li>\n<li>Choose 1 <em>School of Magic</em>; while in this <strong>Stance</strong> the base range of all <strong>Spells</strong> of this school with a range greater than self or touch by 50%, this can not be changed later.</li>\n<li>You get 1 <em>Metamagic Option</em> of your choice, that cannot be changed later, that you may only use while in this <strong>Stance.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"magic-style","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"rank":1,"techniqueType":"stance","kiCost":"0","castingTime":"Special","range":"Self","duration":"Passive","chargeable":false,"mastery":0,"staticBonus":0,"requirements":"**Mysticism/Mysticism: Burst Class Feature**","tags":"stance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9171,"endLine":9181},"techniqueSection":"stance"}}}
